OL,3,GNEWSASix-day strike starts at school   
OL,4,Aover academy plans                     
OL,6,FTeachers and staff at a primary school 
OL,7,Fin Liverpool have begun the first of   
OL,8,Fsix days of strikes over plans to turn 
OL,9,FCatholic schools into academy trusts.  
OL,11,FMembers of the National Education Union
OL,12,F(NEU) at St Austin's Catholic Primary  
OL,13,FSchool said proposals by the           
OL,14,FArchdiocese of Liverpool were being    
OL,15,Fimposed without proper consultation.   
OL,17,FParents of children at the primary     
OL,18,Fschool in Grassendale said they had not
OL,19,Freceived answers from the archdiocese  
OL,20,Fover why it should be turned into an   
OL,21,Facademy.                               
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
