OL,3,GNEWSASix-day strike starts at school   
OL,4,Aover academy plans                     
OL,6,FAn Archdiocese of Liverpool            
OL,7,Frepresentative said the proposals,     
OL,8,Fwhich affect several schools in        
OL,9,FLancashire and on Merseyside, will     
OL,10,Fensure that all children "continue to  
OL,11,Freceive an outstanding Catholic        
OL,12,Feducation".                            
